How to Use
Create the folder structure shown above.
Save the code as recipe_manager.py.
Run:
python recipe_manager.py
Use the menu options to:
Add recipes
View saved recipes
Search by title or ingredient
Edit existing recipes
Delete recipes

The recipes are stored permanently in data/recipes.json, so they remain available after restarting the program.

Project Structure
RecipeManager/
│
├── recipe_manager.py
│
└── data/
    └── recipes.json
